    timeZone: "Africa/Lagos",
    dateStyle: "medium",
    timeStyle: "short"
}) %>
Notice the addition of:

timeZone: "Africa/Lagos"
I recommend adding that explicitly so the display is always in Nigerian time, regardless of where the server is running.

