Structure: ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ (10/10)

Performance: ⭐⭐⭐⭐☆ (9/10)

After moving recentUsers into Promise.all() and using .select(...), I'd happily call this a 10/10 controller. That's the kind of optimization that doesn't change behavior today but pays off as your application grows.

